@startuml
title Weather Station System - State Transition Diagram

state "Shut Down State" as ShutDownState
state "Running State" as RunningState
state "Configuration Mode" as ConfigurationMode
state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode
state "Activity State" as ActivityState

[*] ShutDownState --> RunningState : Power On
RunningState --> ShutDownState : Power Off /\nShutdown Command
RunningState --> ConfigurationMode : Configuration Request
ConfigurationMode --> RunningState : Configuration Completion
RunningState --> ActivityState : Clock Trigger /\nData Collection, Summary Preparation, Status Checking
ActivityState --> RunningState : Activity Completion
RunningState --> ControlledMode : Remote Control Command
ControlledMode --> RunningState : Unspecified Condition for Return to Running State
RunningState --> ShutDownState : Unspecified Condition for Return to Shut Down State

@enduml
